;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">OCR Individual<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">RC6 Warriors Challenge Individual<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 19 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 14:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00danica:<\/strong> 5.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (com bebida e sunset inclu\u00eddos)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">OCR Equipas<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">RC6 Warriors Challenge Equipas<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 19 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 14:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Equipas (4 a 10 elementos):<\/strong> 3.00 \u20ac \/ atleta<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (com bebida e sunset inclu\u00eddos)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o RC6 Warriors Challenge 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre no s\u00e1bado, 19 de setembro de 2026, entre as 14h00 e as 19h30, nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es do Regimento de Cavalaria n\u00ba 6 (RC6) em Braga.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia e formato da corrida de obst\u00e1culos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova tem um tra\u00e7ado cronometrado de cerca de 4 km com diversos obst\u00e1culos militares e de agilidade distribu\u00eddos pelas instala\u00e7\u00f5es do quartel.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem pode participar e como funcionam as equipas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 aberta a toda a popula\u00e7\u00e3o a partir dos 8 anos de idade, podendo ser disputada a n\u00edvel individual (5 \u20ac) ou em equipas de 4 a 10 elementos (3 \u20ac por atleta).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde decorre o levantamento dos kits de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do kit realiza-se nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Decathlon Braga no dia 18 de setembro e na manh\u00e3 de 19 de setembro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que atividades complementares est\u00e3o previstas no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento conta com zonas de balne\u00e1rio para banhos e inclui um Sunset festivo das 18h00 \u00e0s 19h30 com atua\u00e7\u00e3o de DJ e oferta de uma bebida para todos os atletas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"RC6 Warriores Challenge 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-19\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Regimento de Cavalaria n\u00ba 6 (RC6), Rua do Regimento de Infantaria 8\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Braga\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Munic\u00edpio de Braga \/ Regimento de Cavalaria n\u00ba 6 \/ Decathlon\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o RC6 Warriors Challenge 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento decorre no s\u00e1bado, 19 de setembro de 2026, entre as 14h00 e as 19h30, nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es do Regimento de Cavalaria n\u00ba 6 (RC6) em Braga.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia e formato da corrida de obst\u00e1culos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova tem um tra\u00e7ado cronometrado de cerca de 4 km com diversos obst\u00e1culos militares e de agilidade distribu\u00eddos pelas instala\u00e7\u00f5es do quartel.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem pode participar e como funcionam as equipas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 aberta a toda a popula\u00e7\u00e3o a partir dos 8 anos de idade, podendo ser disputada a n\u00edvel individual (5 \u20ac) ou em equipas de 4 a 10 elementos (3 \u20ac por atleta).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde decorre o levantamento dos kits de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento do kit realiza-se nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Decathlon Braga no dia 18 de setembro e na manh\u00e3 de 19 de setembro.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que atividades complementares est\u00e3o previstas no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento conta com zonas de balne\u00e1rio para banhos e inclui um Sunset festivo das 18h00 \u00e0s 19h30 com atua\u00e7\u00e3o de DJ e oferta de uma bebida para todos os atletas.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66166,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[519],"event_type_2":[52,726],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-50162","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-braga","event_type-obstaculos","event_type_2-braga","event_type_2-porto-e-norte"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/rc6-warriores-challenge-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50162","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies"